WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.417
This slide brings Module 11 together.

00:00:02.417 --> 00:00:05.757
Review the patterns you can now recognize and reuse.

00:00:05.757 --> 00:00:11.077
Focus on the decisions behind the syntax: what structure or method fits the problem,

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:15.677
what assumptions are being made, and what you should check before trusting the result.

00:00:15.677 --> 00:00:22.332
In a real Pandas workflow, check the shape and meaning of the DataFrame after important transformations.

00:00:22.332 --> 00:00:28.212
Compact code is useful only when another analyst can still understand what each step changes.

00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:33.972
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:33.972 --> 00:00:39.390
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
